From d9ba895822b6427eb333c3d1519bdeabac354b77 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Evolve Expansion <expansion@example.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:47:39 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Make Silverblood selectable from the first run

- Races can define unlocked() to appear on the evolution screen
  without Mass Extinction or a previous run
- Silverblood is always selectable on the humanoid path
- Mod pack races can opt in with "unlocked": true

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016HmsZNbhLtGaJpfe2FaNeB
